"avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T14:29:17-07:00","id":557341,"title":"","content":"I Believe in Neall","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T17:30:16-07:00","id":557608,"title":"","content":"*wailing* Why aren't you giving us everything we need to make our characters! *weeps*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T18:12:14-07:00","id":557675,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gnomish American</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/537804-the-heart-of-the-sardonyx-system-is-revealed-a-new-legend-begins?p=557608#post557608\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*wailing* Why aren't you giving us everything we need to make our characters! *weeps*</div> </div> </div> </div>Sadly, you will need to weep a bit longer. Due to allergy season, I haven't been sleeping well. I'll put up the new post tomorrow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-17T22:03:15-07:00","id":559065,"title":"","content":"Teaser the Third: <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/codename-sardonyx-schemas-and-scales/\" target=\"_blank\">Schemas and Scales</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-17T22:05:50-07:00","id":559068,"title":"","content":"Very, very cool. It looks like Dataweaver hit it on the head a few weeks back... I'll have more comments after I've had time to ruminate. Also, I'll have to reread Initiative at least one more time while fully awake.<br /> <br /> ...I'm guessing that Influence and Subtlety are new/old names for Grace and Poise? Also, more references to an Awareness Skill. Did I miss something?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":256,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","user":"Gnomish American","date":". 06-18-2015, 01:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-18T13:04:00-07:00","id":559730,"title":"","content":"Wow. Way back when I was first getting to know the first White Wolf games, I was impressed by their movie-like structure, with powers that lasted for scenes instead of specific number of minutes or rounds, the skills that provided broad competencies and so on. The way things are turning out to work on Sardonyx gives me the same feeling, but on a much greater scale*. I have been really keen on the idea of RPGs that play out like movies lately, so this is very appealing to me.<br /> <br /> I can already envision all the scenes in which the main characters somehow survive absolutely ridiculous things because of Scale X Magnitude**. I can see the investigation scenes in which the various quirky CSI people do their things expertly, passing around Focus as they do so.<br /> <br /> *<span style=\"font-size:8px\">Yes, you see what I did there</span><br /> <br /> ** At the same time, it is great that while it might make things more survivable, it still gives a very clear advantage to the more powerful forces, possibly an insurmountably one if the scale difference is too large in too many traits. So I'd say it seems Tyr is still gonna tear apart a Hero level Scion, and Aberrant!Batman is gonna be promptly obliterated if they try to face Aberrant!Darkseid in anything close to a direct approach. But they just might survive that first attack, be rescued by their allies, setting up the sweet revenge when the group improves in power and can stand up to such mighty beings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-18T16:00:12-07:00","id":559928,"title":"","content":"An earlier teaser mentioned that Sardonyx intends to have the Effects you buy with your successes adjust according to Tier and/or Scale. I personally like this idea more than the notion that Magnitude multiplies the number of Effect successes that you get: instead of Scale 4 giving you a tenfold increase in your Effect successes, say that a Scale 4 Effect is roughly ten times as potent as its Scale 1 counterpart. <br /> <br /> I'm also not so fond of the escalating Enhancements granted by Intensity. As the first teaser pointed out, a single Enhancement is a big thing on its own; I suspect that having each rank of Scale grant an increase of one or two to the Intensity would still be more than adequate to represent the power imbalance between major characters. Remember that four Enhancements are sufficient for someone with a two-dice pool to hold his own against someone with a ten-dice pool, assuming the former gets at least one success; since that pretty much spans the range of the majority of dice pools, you're already getting into the realm of &quot;I have an insurmountable advantage&quot; at that point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-18T18:50:03-07:00","id":560177,"title":"","content":"The thing I'm most frustrated about is that we can't actually test these concepts (no, I'm not fishing for more crunch). Neall specifically asks us to &quot;try this out&quot; but gives us no way of doing so. You make very good points, though we don't understand yet how <b>Defense</b> and <b>Soak</b> work (if they exist at all) Also, as the article reminds us these bonuses aren't reflexive or permanent and must be activated at a cost (though my personal theory is that a Patrons affinity Attributes and Skills make them if not permanent then at least easier to access). <br /> <br /> Admittedly, I have to reread the teaser, so I may, in fact, be talking out of rear-end.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-18T20:39:29-07:00","id":560288,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I'm trying to add some polish to the rough document to make a playtest document.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-18T20:46:27-07:00","id":560292,"title":"","content":"Excellent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}